# Agent worktrees. MUST stay ignored: a worktree directory that is tracked gets
# committed as a gitlink (mode 160000). That already happened once —
# `.claude/worktrees/platform-neutral` was committed in 7851bdc and had to be
# stripped during the SHA-256 -> SHA-1 conversion, because a gitlink's object id
# cannot be remapped across hash algorithms.
.claude/worktrees/
.worktrees/
